      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "Note"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "Hi3D refines a coarse mesh using its reference image. It is not a generator on its own.\n\n- Feed any coarse TRIMESH (Hunyuan3D, Trellis, TripoSG, PhantyF Load Mesh, ...).\n- Use the same image the coarse mesh was made from. A cut-out with alpha/mask frames best.\n- The core LoadImage MASK is inverted, so invert_mask is on here.\n- resolution 512 = 1 pass, 1024 = 2 passes, 1536 = 3 passes.\n- 16 GB VRAM: 512 and 1024 work at defaults. 1536 needs tiled_decode on (default).\n- Coarse mesh from Hunyuan3DWrapper's Hy3DGenerateMesh: set its force_offload to False, otherwise\n  that node keeps Hunyuan on the GPU (its flag is inverted) and Hi3D can run out of memory."
      ]
    }
